1
00:00:00,252 --> 00:00:03,172
I've been wondering. You said
it was working when you moved in.

2
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:06,429
(Leonard:)It was. But one night
Sheldon came home from work....

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:09,593
[VIDEO GAME NOISES ON TV]

4
00:00:16,477 --> 00:00:18,267
(Past Sheldon:)What is going on here?

5
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:21,895
Hey, this is Howard and Raj.
They work at the university too.

6
00:00:22,066 --> 00:00:23,106
(Past Leonard:)-Hey.
-Hey.

7
00:00:23,275 --> 00:00:24,405
(Past Sheldon:)I'll get to you later.

8
00:00:26,153 --> 00:00:27,283
(Past Sheldon:)What are you sitting on?

9
00:00:27,446 --> 00:00:30,736
(Past Howard:)I can't speak for these guys,
but I'm sitting on my tushy. Heh, heh.

10
00:00:32,368 --> 00:00:35,038
(Past Howard:)-It's a joke.
-Not a good idea.

11
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,790
-"Tushy" is "buttocks," right?
-Right.

12
00:00:37,957 --> 00:00:39,667
Heh. Hilarious. Heh, heh.

13
00:00:40,626 --> 00:00:42,086
(Past Sheldon:)Explain the couch.

14
00:00:42,253 --> 00:00:45,963
There were people on the first floor
who were moving out and sold it for $100.

15
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:49,632
(Past Leonard:)-Howard and Raj helped me bring it up.
-What's wrong with the furniture we have?

16
00:00:49,802 --> 00:00:50,972
[TURNS OFF VIDEO GAME]

17
00:00:51,137 --> 00:00:53,017
They are lawn chairs.

18
00:00:53,639 --> 00:00:55,219
(Past Leonard:)There was no place for company.

19
00:00:55,725 --> 00:00:59,025
(Past Sheldon:)Did it occur to you that was by design?

